  dcterms:description "Small simulated-data execution of MG-3 from CRC-FONDA/A2-metagenome-snakemake: 64 bins, 262144000-base seed reference, four haplotypes, 128000 single-end reads of 150 bases with three errors; 1 GB IBF and integer 2% mapping error threshold. All 128000 reads mapped and samtools quickcheck passed. The session used 7 Kubernetes attempts, including 6 compatibility-debugging attempts. Snakemake used eight cores within one pod, not a multi-pod executor. Compatibility fixes and cached DREAM-Yara fork are recorded in the audit. The upstream simulation script did not apply mix_bins. Final SAM SHA-256: 5e1bf7cc3cfe762cfd31b23e15d26675836ab24ed3d4b3c09b3a7099e0a91d51."@en ;
